    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i think about what it would actually feel like to just... stop. not just sleep or take a break, but to have everything just go quiet. no more pretending, no more heavy water, no more waking up and feeling that immediate dread. it sounds so peaceful to just not have to be \"someone\" anymore.",
